*Last updated: 2 August 2026*

*   This document applies to https://ampmod.org and all of its subdomains, including https://forums.ampmod.org,
    https://wiki.ampmod.org, https://extensions.ampmod.org, https://commons.ampmod.org, and https://blog.ampmod.org,
    including any future subdomains.

*   By creating an Account, you agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree to these Terms, do not use AmpMod.

*   AmpMod is not affiliated with the Lifelong Kindergarten Group, Scratch Foundation, TurboWarp, or any of their other
affiliates.

